  "description": "A high-performance, thread-safe object pool for .NET 8+ with dependency injection, health checks, OpenTelemetry metrics, warm-up, eviction/TTL, circuit breaker, lifecycle hooks, and scoped pools for multi-tenancy. Perfect for pooling expensive resources like database connections and HTTP clients.",
