  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 4.5.0: Added .NET 11 (net11.0) target framework support, unified pooling policies across all pool types, added IAsyncDisposable support to PoolModel<T> and ScopedPoolManager<T>, added generic PoolConfiguration<T>, fixed semaphore slot releases on synchronous returns, fixed DynamicObjectPool polymorphism, hardened eviction and circuit breaker windowing, and completed DI/health-check extensions. 252 tests passing across .NET 8, 9, 10, and 11.",
